      <title>中国电视出货量下滑15.1%拖累全球，品牌转向海外求增长</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260831/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%87%BA%E8%B4%A7%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%8B%E6%BB%9115.1%E6%8B%96%E7%B4%AF%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E5%93%81%E7%89%8C%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%91%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%96%E6%B1%82%E5%A2%9E%E9%95%BF/</link>
